<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;In Kashmir IGP Sujit Kumar said a single local terrorist remains active, keeping the terror threat alive, while Rajnath Singh called for high operational readiness to tackle security threats. In Manipur hundreds rallied in Ukhrul demanding an end to ethnic violence and the SoO pact, and NHM employees rejected a 5% salary increment, threatening fresh agitation. Manipur districts are now required to hold security review meetings every fortnight under a new SOP. A Kashmir-linked outfit claimed responsibility for a blast on a police outpost in Ghaziabad, prompting the UP ATS to investigate. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNaVJYR29JNkFUWUo5QkJaNzBrelpvTE9qQVNmUG1DS3V0ZHFtckNycXJ0bDlyMFFNSFNXaWpHdDMxcnNpdWVIa2tMQ1NWQUxURXNwcHBGY01RVE1lQ3ViUnJJMGxEeVo2QVhUbUkxaFoxZ1RsYVFXRHdCblh0dUtIZHdGQXJMdjUwTFRleDlPU2ZvNXF4X0hyVjBDRlpLXy1LeDBLLXlocGxlVjBjRGNXdkpxbE5hZjdOc3p0OUpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPSmlaTWlrc2NSTWNsTHJzRXMzb185M1dkVjlwS3hlWFI1Q2txdHpyMjlFam9kWm5vVUI4VVEwa2lzVnZtNVJ5TEhVd0lRV0U5OU1idUhVeGhfSDBGSXhYcVhhUmNPVGFjYzkxaTJ1dU1OTVlZWlA0b3hZNlR6bVlPOXViVEdNZzM1RGJHR21CNGdnZEJ5cGt1NEFPMXFyYlhKSEVJMDU3blhkQ1R3a1RvcFRrRmtKSVNCYmdz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Indepth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNaGQ2Zlo5bzRXVjRuZ2JmU01GY1Mya1NFME01TGcwdVNkTGE3V004RnA2cnBLVUxDZnNiSXdZLUNSNGxNZGJOcENpTkxxSWR5VlVhR3RsbmxsNXI5dUNzUGJMOEdOMnh0WjhSWE56WHVpbzBQWXBzSkhBZk9RV3ExTnF